### Sample Initial Nmap Scans

1. Full TCP port scan:  
   `nmap -p- -T4 --open -oN allports <target>`

2. Service/version/script scan:  
   `nmap -sCV -p<discovered_ports> -oN targeted <target>`

3. UDP common ports:  
   `sudo nmap -sU -p 53,67,68,69,111,123,137,138,139,161,162,445,500,514,1900,5353 -oN udp <target>`

